<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian Bank reported the following daily and year-to-date changes in the volume of Greek mutual fund outstanding shares, net assets and net share prices, as well as total net asset sizes as of June 26.</p>
<p>				  June 27/June 26  June 27/Dec 31, 96</p>
<p>						 (%)		  (%)</p>
<p>NET SHARE PRICES*</p>
<p>  Total market			   -0.01		 7.29</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.03		 5.79</p>
<p>  International funds		  -0.05		10.60</p>
<p>  Growth Funds			   -0.75		49.22</p>
<p>* Prices include distributed dividends</p>
<p>VOLUME OF SHARES</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.05		35.73</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.05		36.37</p>
<p>  International funds		  -0.17		13.97</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.19		30.55</p>
<p>NET ASSETS</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.03		43.93</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.06		42.80</p>
<p>  International funds		  -0.24		23.83</p>
<p>  Growth funds			   -0.58		89.94</p>
<p>All calculations are based on a performance index of mutual funds whose base was set to be equal to 100 on December 31, 1991.</p>
